        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 19:27",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 19,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "For all of my father’s house were but dead men before my lord the king: yet didst thou set thy servant among them that did eat at thine own table. What right therefore have I yet to cry any more unto the king?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 123,
